# Loaded by the tests (test/helper.ts) and passed on to the apps they start, overriding each app's .env: the backend's test database (apps/backend/.env.test), so tests never touch dev data. Variables already set in the shell win, which is how CI sets its own. Storage is a temporary directory per test.

DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/personal_document_manager_test
